%% ACTIVE / INACTIVE state machine (FR-08, FR-09, FR-10).
%% Source of truth: evaluateSystemState() in src/system_state_logic.cpp and
%% StateTask in src/system_state.cpp. StateTask owns EVENT_ACTIVE.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> ACTIVE : boot
    ACTIVE --> INACTIVE : 15 s without motion
    INACTIVE --> ACTIVE : motion (PIR)

    note left of ACTIVE
        EVENT_ACTIVE set
        (at boot by rtos_objects_create,
        on wake by StateTask)
        Any motion restarts the 15 s count
        OLED on, redrawn on sample or mode change
        SensorTask samples every 2 s
        Encoder changes the display mode
        Buzzer sounds outside 18.0-30.0 C
    end note

    note right of INACTIVE
        EVENT_ACTIVE cleared by StateTask
        OLED blanked once, then no display work
        No sampling, no Sample lines
        Encoder ignored
        Buzzer off within about 0.5 s
        PIR still read every 100 ms
        Heartbeat LED still toggles
        StateTask waits for motion, no timeout
    end note
